<title>USA: Houston, Texas, $190 mln airport revs repriced.</title>
<headline>Houston, Texas, $190 mln airport revs repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it repriced a $190 million Houston, Texas, Airport System special facilities revenue bond issue, cutting the yield in 2017 to 5.882 percent from 5.926 percent.</p>
<p>City of Houston, Texas</p>
<p>RE: $190,000,000*</p>
<p>Airport System Special Facilities Revenue Bonds</p>
